description=Two rare weapons, each spawning wherever its ordinary counterpart is found and almost never otherwise. THE CELESTIAL SHOVEL: a large shovel in starfield and gold, triple durability and 1.5x damage, and still a shovel - it digs graves and plows furrows like any other. THE ONYX KATAR: a push dagger on its own custom model, blackened steel with bright edges, 1.5x damage and durability. No settings; rarity is baked in.
